  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain Acrobatics, Climb, Fly, and Swim as class skills. You may use the better of your Dexterity or Strength modifier instead of the normal ability modifier for one of Climb, Acrobatics, Fly, or Swim, chosen when you select this talent. You may select this talent a second time, in which case you may use the better of the two ability score modifiers on all of the chosen skills.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/vocation#toc45\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
